The patch in patches/0001-badusb-autorun.patch modifies these upstream files:

  main/Kconfig.projbuild
  include/managers/badusb_manager.h
  main/main.c
  main/managers/badusb_manager.c

Complete corresponding source for the released firmware is the upstream source at
the pinned commit plus the patch above, together with this repository's build
config and build script. The CI release notes link to both.

